# City sweep (skate cityfuzz --near -1945,-1374,40): west of the steep Twin
# Peaks lots below Upper Market the city's ground ends along a diagonal edge, from about
# (-1990, -1350) to (-1955, -1385), sloping down to z 102 at it, with no boundary wall and nothing
# beyond or below (no catch floor). A skater rolling off it falls out of the world (z -15 after
# about 8 s; three of 4,000 drops there, before this change too). For the world generator; not run by check.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -1970 -1355 112.48 262
hold up 0..60
hold up+left+ollie+grind 60..167
hold up+revert 167..258
hold up+revert 258..295
hold up+walk 295..334
hold up+ollie+revert+walk 334..381
hold up+left 381..406
hold up+ollie+grab+slide 451..490
hold up+revert 490..535
hold right+revert 535..576
hold up 576..662
hold grind 662..752
hold down+left 752..781
hold up+grind 781..869
hold up+right 869..936
hold up 936..1001
hold revert 1001..1013
run 1015
